{"ID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3c0","id":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","tags":"YoLo框架,目标检测","title":"YoLoV3","type":"doc","updated":"20260305145200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260207111650-vuqeeom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207111650-vuqeeom","updated":"20260304135040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"yolov3的论文写的一团糟，但是他非常广泛的应用在各个工业领域之上了。"}]},{"ID":"20260304135041-4kgf5y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304135041-4kgf5y0","updated":"20260304140237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以说是整个系列的开山之作，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以说是对"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260202093525-t8pxku0","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的一次小改进，而现在的YoLoV3应该说是当时的集大成之作。\n对于yolo环境的配置可以看文章："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260303104111-ljr4mxk","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLo环境配置"}]},{"ID":"20260304135216-uxtrvf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304135216-uxtrvf7","updated":"20260304135246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 1000px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260304135236-ps1snrv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1000px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260304151254-z2o8xrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304151254-z2o8xrw","updated":"20260304151547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现在对于yolov3它主要的步骤还是非常基本的：首先特征提取，然后进行目标检测，最后不断迭代。"}]},{"ID":"20260304151548-obkrrfe","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260304151548-obkrrfe","updated":"20260304193300"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260304151551-v44qyjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304151551-v44qyjg","updated":"20260304151601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这基本上是所有目标检测的基本思路。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304193300-0jv1skj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260304193300-0jv1skj","updated":"20260305135551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.yoloV3的模型整体架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260304193353-hgyhain","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304193353-hgyhain","updated":"20260304193410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从网络上找到了一个人家绘制的yoloV3的整体架构图"}]},{"ID":"20260304193310-xcf9s7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304193310-xcf9s7m","updated":"20260304202101"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 1000px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260304193327-90eq7up.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"yolov3的整体架构\n"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1000px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305085601-uohj8nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305085601-uohj8nd","updated":"20260305085726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可见YoLoV3主要包括了三大部分：特征提取部分；特征融合部分，检测头部分；分别指向于图片中的Backbone、NECK、Prediction(head)。"}]},{"ID":"20260305091012-a5jjjn1","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260305091012-a5jjjn1","updated":"20260305091347"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260305091019-sl18fga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091019-sl18fga","updated":"20260305091040"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里需要说明一些图片中的模块究竟表示了什么意思："}]},{"ID":"20260305091040-4qgb0s9","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305091040-4qgb0s9","updated":"20260305091042"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305091042-6dl1oen","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305091042-6dl1oen","updated":"20260305091042"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305091042-ma5ekkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091042-ma5ekkj","updated":"20260305091320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CBL：其本质就是一组标准卷积加上批处理归一化，最后配合一个泄露的激活函数的组合；conv+BatchNorm+LeakyRelu。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305091147-7uyayvx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305091147-7uyayvx","updated":"20260305091147"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305091147-wlzfdvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091147-wlzfdvx","updated":"20260305091319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Resunit：其本质就更加基本了，就是多个CBL之间使用残差连接的一个小单元。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305091230-dnuel67","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305091230-dnuel67","updated":"20260305091230"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305091230-sxdaprt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091230-sxdaprt","updated":"20260305091315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResX：先是一个CBL后面有多个小的残差单元的组合体，其中X表示的是残差单元的层级数量。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305091332-2eg00ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091332-2eg00ao","updated":"20260305091347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 1000px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305091333-r5lwsqy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1000px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20260304151601-3c73ldb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260304151601-3c73ldb","updated":"20260305135551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.1.特征提取部分"}]},{"ID":"20260304151608-7c2oumy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260304151608-7c2oumy","updated":"20260305090202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中提出了一个全新的Darknet架构进行特征提取，并且将原本的全连接神经网络架构完全替换掉了。​​"}]},{"ID":"20260305090208-bxbazi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305090208-bxbazi1","updated":"20260305090734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之中主要的分类网络架构是，下面的就是V2的模型架构"}]},{"ID":"20260304145720-ejzrssu","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260304145720-ejzrssu","style":"text-align: center;","updated":"20260305090641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart LR\n    A[输入X] --\u0026gt; B[Darknet-19]\n    B --\u0026gt; C[Avgpool]\n    C --\u0026gt; D[softmax]"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260305090547-gjuyrvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305090547-gjuyrvr","updated":"20260305090900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而V3的主干网络架构就多了一个线性层"}]},{"ID":"20260305090806-iyarjmd","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260305090806-iyarjmd","style":"text-align: center;","updated":"20260305090847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart LR\n    A[输入X] --\u0026gt; B[Darknet-52]\n    B --\u0026gt; C[Avgpool]\n    C --\u0026gt; D[全连接层]\n    D--\u0026gt; E[softmax]"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260305093014-ymr30yf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093014-ymr30yf","updated":"20260305093120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相较于之前的DarkNet-19现在的DarkNet-52的提升就是在原本的基础上不断的增加网络的深度同时在网络的各个基础之上使用了残差结构"}]},{"ID":"20260305090633-s0d7r33","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260305090633-s0d7r33","updated":"20260305090940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260305090903-b4f2cnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305090903-b4f2cnq","updated":"20260305090940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上整个层是非常的多的，一般而言是以分类网络的层数来定义这个Darknet的层数数据的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305091634-ok48b1x","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305091634-ok48b1x","updated":"20260305093408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260305090940-swjq93r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305090940-swjq93r","updated":"20260305092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 253px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305091445-mg45cdj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 253px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305091936-aa455bn","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305091936-aa455bn","updated":"20260305093408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260305091514-0yg7v9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091514-0yg7v9m","updated":"20260305091935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左边图片中就对应了V3网络整体架构中的Backbone部分，一组对应一块，只不过是将CBL之类的拆开来罢了。"}]},{"ID":"20260305092016-5b32suq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092016-5b32suq","updated":"20260305092211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他的主干网络就是不断的进行下采样的操作过程，从原本输入的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"416\\times 416\\times 32_esc_newline_"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"到最后的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"13\\times 13\\times 1024"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，其中还保留了三组后面需要进入金字塔采样的三种规格大小分别为："}]},{"ID":"20260305092211-syto4ai","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305092211-syto4ai","updated":"20260305092554"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305092213-w8lasz2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305092213-w8lasz2","updated":"20260305092551"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305092213-3gwn87j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092213-3gwn87j","updated":"20260305092551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26×26×512；用来检测小尺寸物体"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305092243-cuqxo2k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305092243-cuqxo2k","updated":"20260305092553"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305092243-btioa8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092243-btioa8v","updated":"20260305092553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"26×26×1024；用来检测中尺寸物体"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305092257-w8labug","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305092257-w8labug","updated":"20260305092554"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305092257-afqlwvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092257-afqlwvh","updated":"20260305092554"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"13×13×1024；用来检测大尺寸物体"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305091936-lha5o1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305091936-lha5o1l","updated":"20260305092704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这三个规格的大小直接进入后面的颈部层进行特征融合的操作。"}]},{"ID":"20260305092743-qj4tpmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092743-qj4tpmw","updated":"20260305093408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是主干网络的主要目的是进行分类任务。这个分类的能力是为了后面的金字塔分类头做准备的。"}]},{"ID":"20260305093147-q53usxe","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260305093147-q53usxe","updated":"20260305093319"},"CalloutType":"TIP","CalloutTitle":"Tip","CalloutIcon":"💡","Children":[{"ID":"20260305093153-yvzmzle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093153-yvzmzle","updated":"20260305093319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在目标检测任务之中，先对主干网络进行预训练，然后将主干网络的分类头也就是最后的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"平均池化、全连接层、softmax层"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​直接去掉，仅仅保留前面的卷积层和残差结构，作为V3架构的主干部分，"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305092433-t0ukff5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305092433-t0ukff5","updated":"20260305135558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2.特征融合部分"}]},{"ID":"20260305092442-cupiich","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305092442-cupiich","updated":"20260305093436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特征融合主要有两种类型分别是Add和concat这两种类型。在这里用的是图像特征金字塔进行特征融合的部分。"}]},{"ID":"20260305093456-fu6vonh","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305093456-fu6vonh","updated":"20260305094518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260305093436-jjhkcok","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093436-jjhkcok","updated":"20260305093447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305093447-hzi0nah.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305093510-e95mzfk","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305093510-e95mzfk","updated":"20260305094518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260305093510-hlah55w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093510-hlah55w","updated":"20260305093600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之Backbone是上面的主干特征提取网络，不断的进行下采样的操作，注意在左边图片之中是从下到上的顺序的。"}]},{"ID":"20260305093600-v0uhxj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093600-v0uhxj2","updated":"20260305093823"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反正就是将主干中的东西，先上采样之后和大的图片concat直接拼接在一起之后得到了三组数据，这三组数据就是融合出来的结果。"}]},{"ID":"20260305093824-2kvbl8z","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260305093824-2kvbl8z","updated":"20260305093854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260305093836-0bilzh9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093836-0bilzh9","updated":"20260305093853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上下采样的过程是不会改变图片的通道数量的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305093854-95b4unj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093854-95b4unj","updated":"20260305093958"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体的流程：首先一张图片经过一堆下采样获得三种尺寸的特征图，我们命名为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"P_1，P_2，P_3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分别表示小中大三种大小的特征图。"}]},{"ID":"20260305093959-80zd24s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305093959-80zd24s","updated":"20260305094049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"P_1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"提取出来在经过一次特征提取也就是CBL获得了第一个特征，也就是用来检测大尺寸的特征图"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_1"}]},{"ID":"20260305094049-2fwbgnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094049-2fwbgnt","updated":"20260305094314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后将"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"P_1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的特征图"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​经过上采样之后和之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"P_2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进行融合，融合后进行特征提取操作便获得了包括了可以检测大尺寸的特征图"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_2"}]},{"ID":"20260305094236-9jic706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094236-9jic706","updated":"20260305094414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后将特征图"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经过上采样并还和后面的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"P_3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"相互融合，融合后进行特征提取的操作便获得了最后的一个特征图"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260305094414-ptx2ava","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094414-ptx2ava","updated":"20260305094518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么这一顿操作之后获得了三个不同的特征图："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"F_1,F_2,F_3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这三个特征图就是经过图像金字塔融合后的特征图"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305094651-ufxvmv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094651-ufxvmv3","updated":"20260305094752"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"融合之后便需要对这东西进行检测了，这里就是最后一部分就是最重要的检测头，目标检测网络架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260305094756-ow2xy9g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305094756-ow2xy9g","updated":"20260305135845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.3.目标检测头部分"}]},{"ID":"20260305094816-tw2gv41","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094816-tw2gv41","updated":"20260305094925"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前就说到了咱们的一张图片经过了特征提取网络，颈部网络之后便得到了三种不同规格的数据类型。分别主要用来判定大中小三种尺寸的目标。"}]},{"ID":"20260305095513-626n6k1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305095513-626n6k1","updated":"20260305095852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里的框仍然使用的是之前网络就已经说明的Anchor框这个东西是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260203094726-7rhefqi","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"Faster R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最先提出来的。在这里每个像素点都输出3个Anchor，那么一张图有三类特征图，每个特征图生成3个Anchor，那么一张图的每一个像素点都会产生9个Anchor。"}]},{"ID":"20260305094809-tvx0f7m","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305094809-tvx0f7m","updated":"20260305100127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"col"},{"ID":"20260305094752-t7sabby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094752-t7sabby","updated":"20260305094809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305094752-cj8ewh1.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305100054-87tyhdp","Type":"NodeSuperBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305100054-87tyhdp","updated":"20260305100127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockLayoutMarker","Data":"row"},{"ID":"20260305094805-zp8qq6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305094805-zp8qq6n","updated":"20260305100055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中第一个是检测小物体，第二个是检测中物体，最后那个是检测大物体。这个大中小的判定需要根据感受野来说，看看单个特征图的像素点对应的原图的大小是多少。"}]},{"ID":"20260305100054-1hgbo7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100054-1hgbo7u","updated":"20260305100126"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那么会产生下面的边界框数量"}]},{"ID":"20260305100126-oguadvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100126-oguadvy","updated":"20260305100127"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305100127-419ngcw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"Type":"NodeSuperBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305100130-zpibew2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100130-zpibew2","updated":"20260305100227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是这个样子会发现他的数据量太大了，因此需要使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"类别置信度"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"和"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"NMS"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对边界框进筛选。"}]},{"ID":"20260305100228-dypisec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100228-dypisec","updated":"20260305100440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每个物体都是产生一组数据"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"x,y,w,h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这三个数据进行预测的，前两者是判定框的中心位置坐标，后二者是判定框的大小问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260305100648-o8k2aie","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100648-o8k2aie","updated":"20260305100751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先需要说明下最核心的边界框预测机制，这个机制是在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111601-2jwxjxd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV2"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中最先提出来的，主要解决的问题网络如何预测出目标在图像里的准确位置和大小。"}]},{"ID":"20260305100754-sz3k3l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100754-sz3k3l0","updated":"20260305100843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络不会直接预测目标框的坐标，而是预测相对偏移和缩放值，再通过这个公式，算出最终目标框。"}]},{"ID":"20260305101120-sbwumx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305101120-sbwumx9","updated":"20260305101227"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个算法的最终目的是为了判定预测框框的中心坐标位置以及长宽进行判定，也就是图片中的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"bx, by, bw, bh"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​。"}]},{"ID":"20260305100911-gd2jdd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305100911-gd2jdd6","updated":"20260305101318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305100913-zttsg5v.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305101220-hdxnted","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305101220-hdxnted","updated":"20260305101327"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首先说一下中心坐标的两个公式"}]},{"ID":"20260305101331-8ajdoc9","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305101331-8ajdoc9","updated":"20260305101419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"b_x = \\sigma(t_x)+c_x \\\\\nb_y = \\sigma(t_y)+c_y"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305101419-93bblnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305101419-93bblnf","updated":"20260305135047"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个公式是用来计算目标框的中心位置的。其中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c_x,x_y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是当前网格的左上角坐标，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"t_x,t_y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是神经完了过输出的预测数据，也就是所谓的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"偏移量"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个偏移量经过sigmoid函数之后会在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"0-1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之间震荡，永远不会使得整个框超过当前的网络。"}]},{"ID":"20260305135048-b17tvqp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305135048-b17tvqp","updated":"20260305135109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"然后就是宽高公式了"}]},{"ID":"20260305135110-a5qzqaa","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305135110-a5qzqaa","updated":"20260305135158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"b_w = p_w * e^{t_w} \\\\\nb_h = p_h * e^{t_h}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305135201-gsvw93l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305135201-gsvw93l","updated":"20260305135303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个公式是用来计算目标框框的宽和高的，也就是缩放处理。通过数据对宽高乘上一个系数进行缩放操作。"}]},{"ID":"20260305135303-mxy648o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305135303-mxy648o","updated":"20260305135502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这样子最后就得到了全部的检测头目标数据量，在这里应该是一个五维向量。每个特征图上的一个像素都对应了一个五维向量，同时由于是cooc数据集还有80个类别向量，因此总共一个像素对应的就是85维向量。"}]},{"ID":"20260305135828-ng829nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305135828-ng829nx","updated":"20260305135836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后就是这么一个巨大无比的网络架构"}]},{"ID":"20260305135503-ipz1wh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305135503-ipz1wh2","updated":"20260305135845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305135655-gm1dl0n.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"YOLOV3网络架构整体"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305135503-74ilk1z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260305135503-74ilk1z","updated":"20260305143217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.YOLOV3的损失函数"}]},{"ID":"20260305141651-m1c253m","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305141651-m1c253m","updated":"20260305143217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\n\\begin{align*}\n\\text{loss} \n\u0026= \\lambda_{\\text{coord}} \\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{obj} \\cdot \\left[ (b_x - \\widehat{b_x})^2 + (b_y - \\widehat{b_y})^2 + (b_w - \\widehat{b_w})^2 + (b_h - \\widehat{b_h})^2 \\right] (2 - w_i \\times h_i) \\\\\n\u0026\\quad + \\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{obj} \\cdot \\left[ -\\log(p_c) + \\sum_{i=1}^n \\text{BCE}(\\hat{c_i}, c_i) \\right] \\\\\n\u0026\\quad + \\lambda_{\\text{noobj}} \\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{noobj} \\cdot \\left[ -\\log(1 - p_c) \\right]\n\\end{align*}\n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305135926-6rs9ery","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305135926-6rs9ery","updated":"20260305141451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.1.正负样本的概念"}]},{"ID":"20260305140823-ja2shi6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140823-ja2shi6","updated":"20260305140910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"网络将输入的图像首先还是划分成 S×S 的网格，每个网格都预设了K个Anchor框。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140052-csnu39f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140052-csnu39f","updated":"20260305140930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"并将这些所有的框定义成三种类型的预测框，分别是正例、负例、和忽略样例。也可以说是正样本、负样本、忽略样本。现在给出这三种类型样本的划分方式。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140802-f1gwxlg","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305140802-f1gwxlg","updated":"20260305141122"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305140935-er2z3f4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305140935-er2z3f4","updated":"20260305140935"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305140935-aasm49t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140935-aasm49t","updated":"20260305141028"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"正样本\n对于我们需要计算真实框和Anchor之间的IOU交并比嘛，那么和该真实框IOU最大的那个就是正样本。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305141029-snzik1p","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305141029-snzik1p","updated":"20260305141029"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305141029-1pbfnyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141029-1pbfnyl","updated":"20260305141058"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"负样本\n对于所有的真实框，和他们的IOU均小于0.5的Anchor就是负样本"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305141058-skpuedi","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305141058-skpuedi","updated":"20260305141122"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305141058-k9at7bm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141058-k9at7bm","updated":"20260305141122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"忽略样本\n和真实框IOU\u003e0.5，但并不是最大IOU的那些Anchor"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305140422-99bgbpx","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260305140422-99bgbpx","updated":"20260305141451"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260305141203-tf2lfti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141203-tf2lfti","updated":"20260305141253"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举个例子，我们输入的一张图片，存在四个物体待检测，那么真实框必定有四个。"}]},{"ID":"20260305141254-mvu1uvt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141254-mvu1uvt","updated":"20260305141354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在检测过程中，正样本也有且仅有四个，这四个就是所谓的以后最重要的那些个Anchor，用来计算定位损失，置信度损失，分类损失的。"}]},{"ID":"20260305141354-any5rur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141354-any5rur","updated":"20260305141430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而负样本应该是背景，就是和这些正样本完全不搭嘎的那些东西，这个玩意儿是以后用来计算置信度损失的"}]},{"ID":"20260305141430-yvsglsq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305141430-yvsglsq","updated":"20260305141451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后的忽略样本就是模棱两可分不大清楚的东西，直接去掉，不要多看。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305140422-eavwmgl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305140422-eavwmgl","updated":"20260305143952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.定位损失（Bounding Box Regression Loss）"}]},{"ID":"20260305143232-gh6hzr1","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305143232-gh6hzr1","updated":"20260305143756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\text{Bounding Box Regression Loss} \n= \\lambda_{\\text{coord}} \\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{obj} \\cdot \\left[ (b_x - \\widehat{b_x})^2 + (b_y - \\widehat{b_y})^2 + (b_w - \\widehat{b_w})^2 + (b_h - \\widehat{b_h})^2 \\right] (2 - w_i \\times h_i)"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305140422-fm8c533","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140422-fm8c533","updated":"20260305141924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个部分的损失函数是针对正样本的一个玩意儿，让预测框的位置、大小尽可能贴合真实框。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140422-i37t4i3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305140422-i37t4i3","updated":"20260305143950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143950-k0nvq4q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305143950-k0nvq4q","updated":"20260305143950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143950-wignu4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143950-wignu4o","updated":"20260305143950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"基础误差项"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(b_x−\\hat{b_x})2+...+(b_h−\\hat{b_h})2"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305143454-1mvfyo7","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260305143454-1mvfyo7","updated":"20260305143640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260305143455-j5j2p2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143455-j5j2p2d","updated":"20260305143552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"b_x,b_y,b_w,b_h"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​网络最终预测的边界框：中心坐标、宽、高；"}]},{"ID":"20260305143505-2920rgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143505-2920rgz","updated":"20260305143640"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\widehat{b_x},\\widehat{b_y},\\widehat{b_w},\\widehat{b_h}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"真实框的中心坐标、宽、高"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-21w9fyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-21w9fyi","updated":"20260305143336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是用来计算真实框框和预测框框之间的位置，大小之间的偏差，计算完毕之后平方再相加起来。"}]},{"ID":"20260305143342-ohw82ld","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305143342-ohw82ld","updated":"20260305143952"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143952-av2qzgp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305143952-av2qzgp","updated":"20260305143952"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143952-bpq6vny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143952-bpq6vny","updated":"20260305143952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"那么最后乘以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"(2 - w_i \\times h_i)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是为了进行小目标的加权处理"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-0r2jirl","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-0r2jirl","updated":"20260305143700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260305143429-tipu7pw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143429-tipu7pw","updated":"20260305143449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"w_i \\times h_i"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是真实框的面积"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305143700-n5lmt82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143700-n5lmt82","updated":"20260305143732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仔细想一想，如果目标越小，那么这个系数也就越大，是不是就相当于把这个的权重尽心拉大了。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-3xt7cnn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-3xt7cnn","updated":"20260305144812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.正样本的置信度损失和分类损失"}]},{"ID":"20260305143826-ip5arpq","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305143826-ip5arpq","updated":"20260305144211"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\text{condidence loss}=\\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{obj} \\cdot \\left[ -\\log(p_c) + \\sum_{i=1}^n \\text{BCE}(\\hat{c_i}, c_i) \\right] \\\\"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-sdcifcy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-sdcifcy","updated":"20260305143915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仅对"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正样本"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"计算，分为左右两个部分，分别优化「框里有没有目标」和「目标是什么类别」。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-5cyq0hz","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-5cyq0hz","updated":"20260305144812"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143958-hd2zp9o","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305143958-hd2zp9o","updated":"20260305144104"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305143958-890dyyq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305143958-890dyyq","updated":"20260305144233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"正样本置信度损失"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"-\\log(p_c)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"}]},{"ID":"20260305144011-f4wnsjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144011-f4wnsjm","updated":"20260305144104"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这东西是二分类交叉熵损失函数。一般来说正样本的置信度标签为1，那么如果预测的置信度pc越接近1，其损失越小，反之越大。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260305144117-rj11aqu","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260305144117-rj11aqu","updated":"20260305144812"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260305144117-d9lqd3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144117-d9lqd3m","updated":"20260305144750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"分类损失"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"\\sum_{i=1}^n \\text{BCE}(\\hat{c_i}, c_i) "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"}]},{"ID":"20260305144704-axjzcqb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144704-axjzcqb","updated":"20260305144812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预测置信度"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"pc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越接近 1，损失越小；越接近 0，损失越大，强制正样本的置信度尽可能趋近于 1"}]},{"ID":"20260305144250-2rurws0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144250-2rurws0","updated":"20260305144252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遍历所有类别，把每个类别的二分类损失相加，得到总分类损失，仅对有目标的正样本计算"}]},{"ID":"20260305144328-5g3brs8","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260305144328-5g3brs8","updated":"20260305144741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260305144330-cknqsfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144330-cknqsfy","updated":"20260305144440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260305144440-b2mh6w0.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260305144506-qmxre9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144506-qmxre9x","updated":"20260305144741"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中真实标签是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有且仅有来给你个数值可能"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或者"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"0"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；而p是预测数值他是经过"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"sigmoid"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"函数激活后的，范围再0到1之间"}]},{"ID":"20260305144602-tcsf7zn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305144602-tcsf7zn","updated":"20260305144738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"p"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是对应了戴帽子的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"c"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是预测值，而"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"y"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对应了不戴帽子的c是真实值"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-v3jpy0z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-v3jpy0z","updated":"20260305145200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.4.负样本的置信度损失"}]},{"ID":"20260305144828-zdgc5r3","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20260305144828-zdgc5r3","updated":"20260305144906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"\\text{LOSS}=\\lambda_{\\text{noobj}} \\sum_{i=0}^{S^2} \\sum_{j=0}^{B} \\mathbb{1}_{i,j}^{noobj} \\cdot \\left[ -\\log(1 - p_c) \\right]\n"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-4bwi3wp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-4bwi3wp","updated":"20260305145005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仅仅对负样本进行计算，也就是对背景进行计算，于之前的正样样本损失进行配对，组成完整的置信度二分类损失。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-lp3ixbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-lp3ixbj","updated":"20260305145020"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"预测置信度pc越接近 0，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"inline-math","TextMarkInlineMathContent":"1−pc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越接近 1，损失越小；越接近 1，损失越大，强制背景框的置信度尽可能趋近于 0。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-3l4tnf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-3l4tnf9","updated":"20260305145118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时一张图片大部分都是负样本，因此为了防止负样本的影响过大这里就增添了一个权重来防止对整个损失函数的过大影响。"}]},{"ID":"20260305140423-fl6cay4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305140423-fl6cay4","updated":"20260305145159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这便是总共的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"yolov3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"架构。"}]},{"ID":"20260305145200-hii6ols","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260305145200-hii6ols","updated":"20260305145200"}}]}